{{define "content"}}{{with .Body}}<main class="final-support">
<section class="final-section"><div class="final-label">Support</div><div class="final-content">
<h1>Support the lab.</h1><p class="final-lead">Nothing here is behind a paywall. Every experiment, file and write-up is free for everyone, people and agents alike. Supporting doesn’t unlock anything. It lets us keep working the way we believe in.</p>
<ol class="support-principles"><li>We prototype and explore. We don’t build products.</li><li>We work in public, unfinished work included.</li><li>We follow curiosity, not a roadmap.</li><li>We stay true to how we actually like to work.</li><li>Everything we make stays free and open, for everyone.</li></ol>
<div class="support-options">
{{if .Paid}}<p>Your subscription: {{.Current}}.</p><a class="u" href="/account">Manage subscription →</a>{{else}}
<form class="support-monthly" data-support-monthly>
<label class="final-label" for="support-amount">Every month</label>
<div class="support-amount-controls"><button type="button" data-amount-step="-1" aria-label="Decrease monthly support">−</button><div class="support-amount-value"><input id="support-amount" name="amount" type="number" min="1" max="9999" step="1" value="42" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Monthly support in US dollars" required><span>USD</span></div><button type="button" data-amount-step="1" aria-label="Increase monthly support">+</button></div>
<p class="support-amount-help" id="support-amount-help">We suggest 42 USD. Choose any amount that feels right, and cancel any time.</p>
<button class="site-button site-support" type="submit">Support monthly →</button>
</form>{{end}}
</div>
<section class="support-year"><p class="final-label">Or fund a whole year</p><h2>999,999.99 USD</h2><p>This one is a bet. A single payment covers a year of basic income for both of us, so the lab can be all we do. We’re serious about working this way. If you want to fund it, we’re ready.</p><a class="u" href="mailto:hej@slop.boutique?subject=Fund%20a%20year">Fund a year →</a></section>
</div></section>
<section class="final-section support-contact"><div class="final-label">Contact</div><div class="final-content"><p>Write to us any time at <a class="u" href="mailto:hej@slop.boutique">hej@slop.boutique</a>. To stay independent, we don’t run ads, take paid partnerships or accept client work. Offers of compute, and things you think we should play with, are always welcome.</p></div></section>
</main>{{end}}{{end}}
